{"id":"wb-7-1071","name":"汀州城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汀州城墙","text":"汀州城墙，位于中国福建省龙岩市长汀县汀州镇，是原汀州、汀州府的城墙，临近现长汀县政府。始建于唐，现存城墙主要为明清时期建造及现代重建，现存近3000米，临近汀江。1996年被列为第四批福建省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%80%E5%B7%9E%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":86565446,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86565446","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0dd43af048b4a1542d840426.jpg","title":"Changting Chengqiang 2013.10.05 17-42-18.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Changting_Chengqiang_2013.10.05_17-42-18.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Changting_Chengqiang_2013.10.05_17-42-18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"福建省长汀县城墙——\n\n丽春烽火台","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Tingzhou City Wall","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Tingzhou_City_Wall"}}